      "claim": "Direct L1 comparative evidence explicitly names cefadroxil among oral cephalosporins with absolute bioavailability greater than 90%, and the very close structural analogue cephradine showed absolute oral bioavailability of 85-100% in humans, far above the 20% threshold.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive",
